## Endpoints

### Data Read (4)
- `GET /api/campaigns` — Get a list of campaigns.
- `GET /integrations/` — Get a list of available integrations.
- `GET /products/redtrack-io/rating_schema.json` — Retrieve the rating schema for RedTrack.io.
- `GET /view` — Retrieve a specific view.

### Config (1)
- `GET /consentconfig/{consentconfigId}/settings.json` — Get consent configuration settings.

